  "name": "Request Sterilization Lot Deletion",
  "version": "HL7 v2.6",
  "chapter": "Materials Management",
  "description": "A request sterilization lot deletion is sent by the placer application to the filler application to request that a lot that had been created in error be removed from the system.  A delete trigger event differs from a cancel trigger event in that a delete acts to remove an error, whereas a cancel acts to prevent a valid request from occurring.  If it is successful, an application acknowledgment is returned.",
